1
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,980
I thought with an extra pair of hands

2
00:02:00,019 --> 00:02:01,040
and plenty of herbs stocked up,

3
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,239
we'd be more than halfway there.

4
00:02:03,579 --> 00:02:04,719
But over the next month,

5
00:02:04,739 --> 00:02:06,379
apart from the customers Shu Qingcang brought,

6
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,599
there were no other sales channels.

7
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,439
Without a fixed storefront,

8
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:11,699
we couldn't get new customers.

9
00:02:11,979 --> 00:02:13,360
Sales just wouldn't budge, no matter what.

10
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,060
I was taking care of the baby

11
00:02:18,259 --> 00:02:19,740
while juggling the herbal sachet business.

12
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:21,979
But over half a month went by,

13
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,659
and I still hadn't found a decent shop.

14
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,419
He's snoring, he's snoring.

15
00:02:26,419 --> 00:02:27,020
Baby.

16
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,460
Come on, step inside and take a look.

17
00:02:32,819 --> 00:02:33,139
Come on.

18
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:38,539
This is the last unit available around here.

19
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:41,000
The space is a bit small,

20
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,860
but the layout, lighting, and decor

21
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,539
are all the best in the area.

22
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,960
And the price, well,

23
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,460
it fits right into your budget.

24
00:02:49,139 --> 00:02:50,900
This is way better than the last few we saw.

25
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:51,400
Right, right.

26
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,539
The classic agent trick.

27
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,520
First they show you the bad ones,

28
00:02:53,539 --> 00:02:54,340
saving the good one for last.

29
00:02:54,340 --> 00:02:55,199
So then you'll rent it.

30
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:56,580
Take a look around first.

31
00:02:58,139 --> 00:02:59,780
It's right on the way to the scenic area.

32
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:00,719
All right, all right.

33
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:01,900
You want to haggle?

34
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,580
Watch me.

35
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:06,520
We feel like this location, well,

36
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,460
it's still a bit far from the village.

37
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:09,659
You mean you think

38
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,900
it's too far from the village,

39
00:03:10,919 --> 00:03:12,080
practically at the scenic area, right?

40
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:14,240
How about I knock the price down a bit?

41
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:15,900
So there's still room, huh?

42
00:03:16,099 --> 00:03:16,699
Still negotiable.

43
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,460
Still negotiable.

44
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:22,460
Painting these walls will cost us.

45
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,060
Right, right, right.

46
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:26,139
Here's the deal.

47
00:03:26,539 --> 00:03:28,000
If you two rent this place,

48
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,639
you'll surely need to redecorate.

49
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:30,719
I'll get the landlord to give you

50
00:03:30,780 --> 00:03:31,419
a rent-free period.

51
00:03:32,819 --> 00:03:34,060
You're pretty straightforward, aren't you?

52
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,580
Come on now.

53
00:03:35,819 --> 00:03:37,879
This is how I make my living.

54
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,560
We really like this place.

55
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:40,020
Good, good.

56
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:41,620
See what's the lowest you can talk

57
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:42,560
the landlord down to.

58
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,479
I'll be honest with you.

59
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,800
The landlord's eager to rent this out,

60
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:48,099
and you two seem pretty sincere.

61
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,500
I'll go talk to the landlord again

62
00:03:49,740 --> 00:03:50,699
and get you a bit of a discount.

63
00:03:51,659 --> 00:03:52,199
For a year,

64
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:53,560
how about 25,000?

65
00:03:55,379 --> 00:03:56,580
25,000 would be great.

66
00:03:56,580 --> 00:03:57,479
Then go ahead, hurry.

67
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:57,939
Right.

68
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:58,680
I'll be right back.

69
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,419
Thank you.

70
00:04:00,139 --> 00:04:01,259
This guy's pretty straightforward.

71
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,120
25,000.

72
00:04:02,219 --> 00:04:02,960
25,000.

73
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,240
25,000.

74
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,120
Let me tell you,

75
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,379
I was in Shenzhen so long,

76
00:04:06,379 --> 00:04:07,419
I think everyone's out to trick me.

77
00:04:07,439 --> 00:04:08,599
I'm really not used to someone like him.

78
00:04:08,659 --> 00:04:09,879
So everyone can come in through here...

79
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:10,520
I made this.

80
00:04:11,099 --> 00:04:11,620
You two, you two.

81
00:04:13,819 --> 00:04:16,500
I'm really sorry.

82
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,560
The landlord said

83
00:04:17,779 --> 00:04:19,160
he'd rent to others for 25,000,

84
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,139
but to rent it to you,

85
00:04:20,699 --> 00:04:21,759
he wants 50,000.

86
00:04:21,939 --> 00:04:22,740
50,000?

87
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,519
I've never seen a scam like this before.

88
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,259
One phone call and the price doubles.

89
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:29,100
It's not me, the landlord said it.

90
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,779
Who's the landlord?

91
00:04:30,759 --> 00:04:32,319
That model pig farmer from our village,

92
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:33,019
Yao Jiahao.

93
00:04:36,740 --> 00:04:37,699
We finally found a

94
00:04:37,699 --> 00:04:38,600
decent storefront,

95
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:39,639
and it turns out to be Yao Jiahao's.

96
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,980
He's such a big

97
00:04:40,980 --> 00:04:41,839
pig farm boss,

98
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,740
yet he's so petty.

99
00:04:44,139 --> 00:04:45,319
Forget it, don't get upset.

100
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,459
Not renting it is fine too.

101
00:04:46,459 --> 00:04:47,519
That place has bad feng shui anyway.

102
00:04:48,139 --> 00:04:49,720
But we've been looking for half a month.

103
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:51,139
So many storefronts,

104
00:04:51,259 --> 00:04:52,839
either the location's wrong

105
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,480
or the price is wrong. What do we do?

106
00:04:54,860 --> 00:04:56,199
Let's just keep looking.

107
00:04:56,819 --> 00:04:57,600
Can't rush it.

108
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,639
It can't be all of it, right?

109
00:05:02,019 --> 00:05:02,759
Is this our stuff

110
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,339
that got stolen?

111
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:04,920
No, no, no, no, no!

112
00:05:05,199 --> 00:05:05,620
It's dangerous.

113
00:05:06,699 --> 00:05:07,240
What are you doing?

114
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:11,240
Alright, go on.

115
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:11,980
You go!

116
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:13,839
You go.

117
00:05:16,660 --> 00:05:17,579
Who's there? I'm calling the cops!

118
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:19,800
Xiaofang.

119
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,000
So it's you.

120
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,899
You're finally back.

121
00:05:21,939 --> 00:05:22,819
If it isn't my bro Xiaowei.

122
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,819
How'd the storefront hunting go today?

123
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:26,899
What a rare visit.

124
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,399
What do you two want?

125
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,060
This, well, look.

126
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,199
Up to no good, that's for sure.

127
00:05:33,259 --> 00:05:33,879
Better run.

128
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,680
We heard you're making money.

129
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:36,120
No, no.

130
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:36,779
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

131
00:05:36,899 --> 00:05:37,199
No.

132
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:38,620
This time it's really good news.

133
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,019
Right.

134
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:40,720
We're here to talk business.

135
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:43,800
You want to buy herbal sachets?

136
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:44,759
Right.

137
00:05:46,459 --> 00:05:46,939
Forgive my manners.

138
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:47,980
Hurry, come on in.

139
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:48,639
Xiaofang.

140
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,519
These herbal sachets of yours,

141
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:50,620
we think have real potential.

142
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:52,040
The tourists who come here,

143
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,519
they all ask about them.

144
00:05:53,459 --> 00:05:53,819
Yeah.

145
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,800
And the three of us, you see.

146
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,500
The two of us here,

147
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:00,439
we opened a guesthouse.

148
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:03,740
The three of you... I mean two.

149
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:04,500
Pretty impressive.

150
00:06:05,579 --> 00:06:06,399
Not bad, not bad.

151
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,180
Right, right, exactly.

152
00:06:07,220 --> 00:06:08,620
Inside our place,

153
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:10,079
we set up an Integrated Culture and Tourism Zone.

154
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:10,459
Yeah.

155
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,360
We'd like to sell

156
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,379
your herbal sachets.

157
00:06:12,779 --> 00:06:14,040
And that'd help boost

158
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:15,060
our guesthouse business too.

159
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,720
Let's make money together.

160
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:17,860
Sure, sure.

161
00:06:18,220 --> 00:06:19,199
How many do you want?

162
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,399
A hundred.

163
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:24,180
But,

164
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,480
Xiaofang, here's the thing.

165
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,480
Given our relationship,

166
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:27,160
it goes without saying.

167
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:27,959
We're old classmates,

168
00:06:27,959 --> 00:06:28,720
and you almost became

169
00:06:29,019 --> 00:06:30,060
our buddy's wife.

170
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:32,420
Is this price okay with you?

171
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:34,740
The price is easy.

172
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:36,360
Easy.

173
00:06:36,779 --> 00:06:37,579
Xiaofang's easy to deal with.

174
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,160
No big deal at all.

175
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:39,660
Here's what.

176
00:06:39,899 --> 00:06:40,699
This order,

177
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,399
I'll give it for free.

178
00:06:44,379 --> 00:06:45,500
Free, absolutely free.

179
00:06:46,060 --> 00:06:47,100
Did you read that wrong?

180
00:06:47,740 --> 00:06:48,300
No, I read it right.

181
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:49,000
Read it right, read it right.

182
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,000
Just this amount.

183
00:06:50,379 --> 00:06:51,160
That's what I mean. Free.

184
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:52,959
This amount's great, this amount.

185
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,439
Wait, are you serious?

186
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:56,899
Xiaofang's really giving it for free?

187
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:58,220
Sure am.

188
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:03,379
Didn't I already tell you two?

189
00:07:03,379 --> 00:07:04,300
Don't tell her,

190
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:05,620
but I invested in the guesthouse too.

191
00:07:06,379 --> 00:07:07,180
If she finds out,

192
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:08,100
she definitely won't

193
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,139
charge us any money.

194
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:10,740
The little stake you put in,

195
00:07:11,139 --> 00:07:12,339
I'm too embarrassed to even mention it.

196
00:07:12,899 --> 00:07:13,360
What do you mean?

197
00:07:14,100 --> 00:07:14,540
What do you mean?

198
00:07:16,819 --> 00:07:18,120
You really don't have that much clout.

199
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:19,939
Xiaofang isn't charging us

200
00:07:20,180 --> 00:07:21,540
because she's making a deal with us.

201
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:23,279
What kind of deal?

202
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,040
A hundred herbal sachets

203
00:07:25,779 --> 00:07:26,459
in exchange for a bunch of

204
00:07:26,899 --> 00:07:27,899
guesthouse owners' contact info.

205
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:29,019
Exactly.

206
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,939
You think we two got the better deal,

207
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:31,839
but really it's Xiaofang

208
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,980
who got the better of us.

209
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,339
This time,

210
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,800
we lost big.

211
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:41,879
I can't do this anymore.

212
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,360
Come on, just hang in there a bit longer.

213
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:46,959
Once we finish delivering here,

214
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:48,839
we've still got the west side to cover.

215
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,339
No way, today I've

216
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,480
way exceeded my exercise limit.

217
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:55,459
Let your dad deliver it. I'm exhausted.

218
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:59,160
My dad went to town to deliver herbs.

219
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:01,199
He won't be back till after dark.

220
00:08:02,540 --> 00:08:03,600
The guesthouses in our village

221
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:04,459
are either up in the mountains

222
00:08:04,459 --> 00:08:05,259
or deep in the woods.

223
00:08:06,139 --> 00:08:06,839
Day after day,

224
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:08,600
you make all these trips

225
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,459
and still barely earn a thing.

226
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:12,420
Take a break, then.

227
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,579
I really am wiped out too.

228
00:08:15,540 --> 00:08:15,959
Coffee!

229
00:08:20,139 --> 00:08:20,579
Oh my gosh.

230
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:22,040
Hello there, boss.

231
00:08:22,819 --> 00:08:23,240
Hello.

232
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:24,660
Two iced Americanos.

233
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,579
One Americano and one latte.

234
00:08:27,620 --> 00:08:28,800
That's 38. Just scan the code yourself.

235
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:33,259
My phone's dead. You scan it.

236
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:34,820
I didn't bring my phone.

237
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:35,799
Wait, seriously?

238
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:37,080
Who goes out without a phone these days?

239
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,259
What are you on about? Just pay.

240
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:39,500
Gotta cut down on the extra weight.

241
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:41,799
Boss, will you still be here tomorrow?

242
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,679
I'll pay you tomorrow.

243
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,320
It doesn't matter.

244
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:45,519
These are on the house.

245
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,539
Where you'll run into me each day,

246
00:08:47,539 --> 00:08:47,899
is never guaranteed.

247
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,899
When it's sunny, we head to the mountaintop

248
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:51,039
for coffee above the clouds.

249
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,899
When it rains, we duck under a bridge

250
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,340
for a rainy-season special.

251
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,860
Running into me is destiny.

252
00:08:57,139 --> 00:08:58,379
Thank you, thank you.

253
00:08:59,179 --> 00:09:00,120
Boss, this shop of yours,

254
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,279
called Sister Yan's Coffee,

255
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,840
doesn't quite match your vibe.

256
00:09:03,659 --> 00:09:04,639
Sister Yan is my wife.

257
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:06,620
Her dream, you see,

258
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:07,700
was to open a coffee shop.

259
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,700
As for me, I saved up for ages.

260
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:11,659
But somehow,

261
00:09:12,100 --> 00:09:13,259
it was always just a little short.

262
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,019
Then one day it hit me:

263
00:09:16,019 --> 00:09:16,940
not everything

264
00:09:17,299 --> 00:09:17,679
has to wait

265
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,779
until everything is perfectly ready.

266
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:20,720
Sure, I don't have

267
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,720
enough money for a shop,

268
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,440
but I've got a van.

269
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,740
Wherever I drive, the customers come.

270
00:09:28,039 --> 00:09:28,700
Once I sell out here,

271
00:09:28,919 --> 00:09:29,700
I move on to the next stop.

272
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,120
And along the way,

273
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,100
I take her to see

274
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,419
the scenery she never got to see.

275
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:45,559
Off we go.

276
00:09:47,379 --> 00:09:48,100
Boss, wait a second.

277
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:50,500
We made this ourselves.

278
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:51,720
Please take it.

279
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,139
An herbal sachet.

280
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:52,779
That's right.

281
00:09:52,919 --> 00:09:53,620
It's the Calming blend.

282
00:09:53,620 --> 00:09:54,320
When you go to sleep,

283
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,480
you can put it by your bed.

284
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:55,820
Thank you.

285
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:56,580
Goodbye.

286
