415
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,340
Just go for it boldly.

416
00:14:33,019 --> 00:14:33,799
Then it's settled.

417
00:14:34,059 --> 00:14:34,639
Here's to a great partnership.

418
00:14:38,559 --> 00:14:39,159
To a great partnership.

419
00:14:39,399 --> 00:14:39,980
To a great partnership.

420
00:15:35,059 --> 00:15:35,940
