455
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:40,879
Lijiang County, Guidong City.

456
00:16:40,919 --> 00:16:44,340
Herb Hive Culture and Creativity Co., Ltd.

457
00:16:44,519 --> 00:16:46,419
Legal Representative: Yang Xiaofang.

