516
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,859
Yeah, but you're the half and I'm the eight.

517
00:18:32,859 --> 00:18:33,519
I've got three taels on you.

518
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,380
Daddy's here.

519
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:41,160
Daddy's here.

520
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:43,000
You know me, don't you? You know me.

521
00:18:43,039 --> 00:18:43,740
Thanks for your hard work.

522
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:44,900
Super dad.

523
00:18:45,059 --> 00:18:45,380
Your daddy's here.

524
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:48,220
