543
00:19:26,839 --> 00:19:28,380
For money, there's nothing you wouldn't do.

544
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:33,200
But I know I was wrong.

545
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:37,460
That day,

546
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,099
when you all tied me up,

547
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:41,859
that's when I finally realized

548
00:19:42,859 --> 00:19:44,019
