550
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,460
I was tied up, couldn't move.

551
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:50,319
Couldn't even speak straight.

552
00:19:52,700 --> 00:19:53,460
Even though I knew

553
00:19:53,539 --> 00:19:54,720
