563
00:20:11,759 --> 00:20:12,519
It's karma, all right.

564
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:14,299
Pure karma.

565
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:16,559
Son,

566
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,180
