00:43:36,059 --> 00:43:37,659
let go of overnight.

1136
00:43:38,639 --> 00:43:40,159
Weren't you about to tell me something?

1137
00:43:42,980 --> 00:43:43,500
Dad.

1138
00:43:44,059 --> 00:43:45,340
There's something I want to do.

1139
00:43:45,519 --> 00:43:46,920
But I'm just not sure about it.

1140
00:43:47,380 --> 00:43:48,099
No matter what it is,

1141
00:43:48,280 --> 00:43:49,980
if you've got the urge to do it,

1142
00:43:50,039 --> 00:43:50,880
that means...

1143
00:43:51,400 --> 00:43:52,860
the time has come.
